# Units Mavind explicitly enables. (Most are enabled by their package; listing
# them makes the intent auditable and survives package default changes.)

NetworkManager.service
iwd.service
bluetooth.service
systemd-timesyncd.service
systemd-resolved.service
systemd-oomd.service
seatd.service
mavind-firstboot.service
# NOTE: greetd is NOT enabled here — the live ISO autologins on tty1 and execs
# mavind-session. The installer (installer/mavind-install) enables greetd on the
# installed system instead.
